      "reason": "Samba 4.19.5 asserts the Windows 11 / Server 2022 and earlier destination-open SHARE_READ|SHARE_WRITE restriction. Current MS-FSA 2.1.5.15.12 uses READ|WRITE|DELETE, so this fixture succeeds rather than returning SHARING_VIOLATION. The full unmodified diagnostic remains recorded as failed, not passed.",
